"**Euclid's Lemma**\n"
"\n"
"If §0 and §1 is coprime to §2, then §3."
msgstr ""
"**Лемма Евклида**\n"
"\n"
"Если §0, а §1 взаимно просто с §2, то §3."

#: Game.Levels.Congruence.L05_mod_trans
msgid "Transitivity of Congruences"
msgstr "Транзитивность сравнений"

#: Game.Levels.Divisibility.L02_negative_multiples
msgid "5 divides -15."
msgstr "5 делит -15."

