#: Game.Levels.Divisibility.L02_negative_multiples
msgid ""
"Divisibility isn't limited to positive numbers — it works across all "
"integers (§0), including negative ones!\n"
"\n"
"Here we want to prove §1, which means finding an integer §2 such that §3.\n"
"Once you provide the witness with §4, finish off the arithmetic using a "
"powerful new tactic: §5.\n"
"\n"
"**Tip:** Every time you unlock a new tactic (like §6 or §7), it is added to "
"the **Tactics** tab on the right. Check that tab anytime you want to read "
