#. §2: $\\exists x, a \\cdot x \\equiv b \\pmod m$
#: Game.Doc.Theorems.LinCong
msgid ""
"**Solvability (Sufficient Condition)**\n"
"\n"
"If §0 and §1, then §2."
msgstr ""
"**Разрешимость (достаточное условие)**\n"
"\n"
"Если §0 и §1, то §2."

